  "input_text": "$\\tan \\theta < 0$이고 $\\cos \\left( \\frac{\\pi}{2} + \\theta \\right) = \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}$일 때, $\\cos \\theta$의 값은?\n① $- \\frac{2 \\sqrt{5}}{5}$\t② $- \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}$\t③ $\\mathrm{0}$\n④ $\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}$\t⑤ $\\frac{2 \\sqrt{5}}{5}$\n",
