  "reference_answer_text": "⑤",
  "reference_solution": "[정답] ⑤\n\n[해설]\n$\\cos \\left( \\frac{\\pi}{2} + \\theta \\right) = - \\sin \\theta$이므로\n$\\sin \\theta = - \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}$\n$\\tan \\theta < 0$, $\\sin \\theta < 0$이므로 $\\theta$는 제 $\\mathrm{4}$사분면의 각이고, $\\cos \\theta > 0$이다.\n$\\cos^{2} \\theta$$= 1 - \\sin^{2} \\theta$\n$= 1 - \\left( \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5} \\right)^{2}$\n$= \\frac{4}{5}$\n$\\therefore$ $\\cos \\theta = \\frac{2}{5} \\sqrt{5}$\n",
  "problem_text": "$\\tan \\theta < 0$이고 $\\cos \\left( \\frac{\\pi}{2} + \\theta \\right) = \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}$일 때, $\\cos \\theta$의 값은?\n① $- \\frac{2 \\sqrt{5}}{5}$\t② $- \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}$\t③ $\\mathrm{0}$\n④ $\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}$\t⑤ $\\frac{2 \\sqrt{5}}{5}$\n",
